{
  "name": "車伕座椅與馬轅",
  "icon": "tm_wagon:triple_seat",
  "category": "tm_wagon:workshop",
  "sortnum": 1,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "爲每輛車選擇一套純木製或帶靠背車伕座椅，兩種都能安裝馬車櫃。$(br2)普通和加長車廂使用單人或雙人座；加寬車廂還可選擇三人座。雙人座左側是駕駛位，三人座在中間，其餘位置供乘客使用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "右鍵$(bold)可見的坐墊或木製坐面上表面$(reset)入座，併爲乘客留出足夠空間。$(br2)雙人木座由同木質單人座合成。三人木座使用三個單人座，或一個雙人座加一個單人座，木質保持一致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "tm_wagon:component_recipe",
      "recipe": "tm_wagon:double_wooden_seat",
      "alternative": 0,
      "heading": "book.tm_wagon.recipe",
      "text": "兩個單人木製座椅，必須同木質。亂序合成。",
      "anchor": "double_wooden_seat"
    },
    {
      "type": "tm_wagon:component_recipe",
      "recipe": "tm_wagon:triple_wooden_seat",
      "alternative": 0,
      "heading": "book.tm_wagon.recipe",
      "text": "一個雙人和一個單人木製座椅，必須同木質。亂序合成。",
      "anchor": "triple_wooden_seat"
    },
    {
      "type": "tm_wagon:component_recipe",
      "recipe": "tm_wagon:triple_wooden_seat",
      "alternative": 1,
      "heading": "book.tm_wagon.recipe",
      "text": "也可以使用三個同木質單人木製座椅。亂序合成。",
      "anchor": "triple_wooden_seat_alternative"
    },
    {
      "type": "tm_wagon:component_recipe",
      "recipe": "tm_wagon:single_seat",
      "alternative": 0,
      "heading": "book.tm_wagon.recipe",
      "text": "繼承單人木製座椅木質。羊毛決定坐墊顏色，上方木板可以任意木質。",
      "anchor": "single_seat"
    },
    {
      "type": "tm_wagon:component_recipe",
      "recipe": "tm_wagon:double_seat",
      "alternative": 0,
      "heading": "book.tm_wagon.recipe",
      "text": "繼承雙人木製座椅木質。三塊羊毛必須同色；木板可以任意木質。",
      "anchor": "double_seat"
    },
    {
      "type": "tm_wagon:component_recipe",
      "recipe": "tm_wagon:triple_seat",
      "alternative": 0,
      "heading": "book.tm_wagon.recipe",
      "text": "繼承三人木製座椅木質。三塊羊毛必須同色；木板可以任意木質。",
      "anchor": "triple_seat"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "單馬轅和雙馬轅適用於所有車廂。兩套單馬轅亂序合成雙馬轅。出發前，爲單馬轅拴好一匹動物，或爲雙馬轅拴好兩匹。$(br2)馬轅使用統一的木製外觀，選擇類型時按希望使用的拉車動物數量決定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "tm_wagon:component_recipe",
      "recipe": "tm_wagon:double_horse_shafts",
      "alternative": 0,
      "heading": "book.tm_wagon.recipe",
      "text": "兩套單馬轅，亂序合成。",
      "anchor": "double_horse_shafts"
    }
  ],
